# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test your knowledge {#test-your-knowledge}"
msgstr "Subukin ang iyong kaalaman {#test-your-knowledge}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After completing the reading and activities in this course, click the button below to navigate to IBM&reg; Training, where you can take the badging exam for Quantum diagonalization algorithms.\n"
msgstr "Pagkatapos makumpleto ang mga pagbabasa at aktibidad sa kursong ito, i-click ang pindutan sa ibaba para pumunta sa IBM&reg; Training, kung saan maaari kang kumuha ng badging exam para sa Quantum diagonalization algorithms.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The exam consists of 20 questions, and you must answer at least 16 correctly to pass. Upon receiving a passing score, your badge will automatically be sent to the email you used to register with IBM&reg; Training.\n"
msgstr "Ang pagsusulit ay binubuo ng 20 tanong, at kailangan mong sagutin nang tama ang hindi bababa sa 16 para makapasa. Sa pagtanggap ng passing score, awtomatikong maipapadala ang iyong badge sa email na ginamit mo para mag-rehistro sa IBM&reg; Training.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure you're ready to take the exam. If you don't receive a passing score in two attempts, the exam becomes temporarily locked.\n"
msgstr "Siguraduhing handa ka nang kumuha ng pagsusulit. Kung hindi ka makakuha ng passing score sa dalawang pagkakataon, pansamantalang mala-lock ang pagsusulit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notice: These exams on the IBM Training site may be temporarily unavailable in the next few days, due to maintenance.\n"
msgstr "Paunawa: Ang mga pagsusulit na ito sa IBM Training site ay maaaring pansamantalang hindi available sa susunod na ilang araw, dahil sa maintenance.\n"

